# Bridge tren Mac — cau hinh (copy thanh .env, dien gia tri that).
# KHONG commit file .env (da gitignore). Chi commit file .env.example nay.
#
# Relay tren Render (doc tu Render Dashboard → service relay → Environment):
RELAY_URL=https://muse-relay-p3is.onrender.com
RELAY_CANVAS_KEY=<paste from Render Dashboard>
#
# Bridge phoi API cho Canvas tren Mac (Canvas chay cong 5521, khong doi).
# Bridge dung cong RIENG 5522 — phai la cong trong tren Mac.
BRIDGE_HOST=127.0.0.1
BRIDGE_PORT=5522
#
# Tuy chon cho dong goi thanh app macOS (xem INTEGRATION.md):
# BRIDGE_DATA_DIR — thu muc journal task (mac dinh: thu muc chua script).
#   App dong goi nen chi toi Application Support cua no.
# BRIDGE_PARENT_PID — PID cua app; bridge tu tat khi app thoat.
# BRIDGE_READY_FILE — file JSON bridge ghi {host, port, url} khi san sang.
# BRIDGE_PORT=0 — he dieu hanh chon cong trong; app doc cong tu ready-file.
# BRIDGE_DATA_DIR=
# BRIDGE_PARENT_PID=
# BRIDGE_READY_FILE=
